  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OVC Kampala Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to prevent new HIV infections and provide care for OVC and their caregivers in Kampala district. The OVC Kampala Activity will address critical barriers to HIV service access, uptake, and adherence and scale up access to high-impact HIV prevention services, improving health and social well-being outcomes among OVC and AGYW and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
